{"seq":3,"slug":"data-modeling-and-dbt","title":"数据建模与 dbt","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/orchestration-and-data-quality/data-modeling-and-dbt","wordCount":1949,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据建模与-dbt\">数据建模与 dbt</h1><p>把仓库里散落的原始表变成业务能直接查询的可信资产，这件事在 2026 年几乎等同于&quot;写好 dbt&quot;。dbt 不是又一个 SQL 编辑器，它的核心贡献是把数据建模变成了一份可编译、可测试、可追溯血缘的软件工程产物：每个模型是一段 <code>SELECT</code>，dbt 负责把它物化成表或视图、按依赖顺序调度、并在物化前后跑断言。当它嵌入到编排与数据质量的语境里时，它既是&quot;转换层&quot;（ELT 里的 T），又是质量门的执行者——这正是为什么本章把建模和质量放在一起讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>dbt 的世界由四类对象支撑：模型（model，一段 SQL）、源（source，声明上游原始表）、测试（test，对列或表的断言）、以及由它们之间的 <code>ref()</code> / <code>source()</code> 引用自动推导出的有向无环图（DAG）。开发者只写 <code>SELECT</code> 与 YAML 声明，dbt 在编译期解析所有 <code>ref()</code> 调用，构造出依赖图，再按拓扑序执行。2026 年随着 dbt Fusion 引擎（2025 年 5 月公测、Rust 重写、号称解析与执行最高快 30 倍）和基于其底座的 dbt Core v2.0（2026 年 6 月发布首个 alpha）落地，编译期还多了一项能力：原生 SQL 理解与列级血缘，使得&quot;只改了 <code>stg_payments</code> 里 <code>fct_orders</code> 没用到的列就跳过 <code>fct_orders</code> 重建&quot;这样的静态分析成为现实（<a href=\"https://blog.dataengineerthings.org/a-data-platform-engineers-guide-to-dbt-fusion-in-2026-eab68945a8bd\">A Data Platform Engineer&#39;s Guide to DBT Fusion in 2026</a>、<a href=\"https://medium.com/@karthikrajashekaran/dbt-core-v2-0-is-here-one-engine-open-source-built-on-fusion-1aaad0b03b11\">dbt Core v2.0 Is Here</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  RAW[原始表&lt;br/&gt;raw schema] --&gt; SRC[source 声明&lt;br/&gt;+ source freshness]&#10;  SRC --&gt; STG[staging&lt;br/&gt;清洗/改名/类型]&#10;  STG --&gt; INT[intermediate&lt;br/&gt;业务逻辑拼装]&#10;  INT --&gt; MART[marts&lt;br/&gt;面向业务的实体]&#10;  STG --&gt; MART&#10;  MART --&gt; BI[BI / 报表 / 反向 ETL]&#10;  STG -.schema test.-&gt; Q{质量门}&#10;  MART -.contract + unit test.-&gt; Q&#10;  Q -.失败则阻断.-&gt; BI\">flowchart TD\n  RAW[原始表&lt;br/&gt;raw schema] --&gt; SRC[source 声明&lt;br/&gt;+ source freshness]\n  SRC --&gt; STG[staging&lt;br/&gt;清洗/改名/类型]\n  STG --&gt; INT[intermediate&lt;br/&gt;业务逻辑拼装]\n  INT --&gt; MART[marts&lt;br/&gt;面向业务的实体]\n  STG --&gt; MART\n  MART --&gt; BI[BI / 报表 / 反向 ETL]\n  STG -.schema test.-&gt; Q{质量门}\n  MART -.contract + unit test.-&gt; Q\n  Q -.失败则阻断.-&gt; BI</pre><p>下表对比了 dbt 与编排器各自的职责边界，这是初学者最容易混淆的地方：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>dbt（转换层）</th>\n<th>编排器（Airflow / Dagster）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解决的问题</td>\n<td>仓库内 SQL 转换的依赖、物化、测试</td>\n<td>端到端管道：摄取→转换→反向 ETL 的调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调度粒度</td>\n<td>模型 DAG（仓库内）</td>\n<td>任务 / 资产 DAG（跨系统）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否完整编排</td>\n<td>否，内置调度有限</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026 典型组合</td>\n<td>作为编排器中的一个 / 一组任务运行</td>\n<td>Airflow + Cosmos 把每个 dbt 模型渲染为独立任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分层建模-staging-intermediate-marts\">分层建模：staging → intermediate → marts</h2><p>dbt 官方推荐的三层结构不是审美洁癖，而是为了把&quot;复杂度&quot;关进可控的笼子里。staging 层是原始数据进入仓库后的第一站，规则是一对一镜像每张源表，只做轻量清洗——改列名、转类型、去重，绝不做 join；它给整个项目提供一套统一命名的&quot;原子积木&quot;（<a href=\"https://docs.getdbt.com/best-practices/how-we-structure/1-guide-overview\">How we structure our dbt projects</a>）。intermediate 层把多个 staging 实体拼起来，吸收掉最终 mart 模型里那些会反复出现的中间逻辑，让 mart 保持可读。marts 层则是面向业务的成品：每个 mart 表达一个明确的实体与粒度（一笔订单、一个客户、一次点击）。dbt Labs 的研究称，采用标准化项目结构的团队比临时拼凑结构的团队达成洞察的速度快 2.3 倍（<a href=\"https://docs.getdbt.com/best-practices/how-we-structure/1-guide-overview\">How we structure our dbt projects</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- models/staging/stg_payments.sql&#10;with source as (&#10;    select * from {{ source(&#39;stripe&#39;, &#39;payments&#39;) }}&#10;)&#10;select&#10;    id                         as payment_id,&#10;    order_id,&#10;    payment_method,&#10;    amount / 100.0            as amount_usd,   -- 分转元&#10;    created_at::timestamp     as created_at&#10;from source&#10;&#10;-- models/marts/fct_orders.sql&#10;with payments as (&#10;    select * from {{ ref(&#39;stg_payments&#39;) }}&#10;)&#10;select&#10;    order_id,&#10;    count(*)                  as payment_count,&#10;    sum(amount_usd)           as order_total&#10;from payments&#10;group by 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- models/staging/stg_payments.sql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    select</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {{ source(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'stripe'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'payments'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id                         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payment_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    payment_method,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_usd,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分转元</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- models/marts/fct_orders.sql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payments </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    select</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {{ ref(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'stg_payments'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payment_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount_usd)           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payments</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">group by</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关于维度建模，2026 年的实践与教科书里的 Kimball 星型模型出现了温和分化。在存储便宜、计算昂贵的现代仓库里，团队更倾向于&quot;宽表&quot;思路：只要对回答某个 mart 核心实体的问题有用，就大方地把相关概念的列都借进来，而不再严格遵守传统星型模型对维度与事实的洁净拆分（<a href=\"https://towardsdatascience.com/staging-intermediate-mart-models-dbt-2a759ecc1db1/\">Staging vs Intermediate vs Mart Models in dbt</a>）。星型模型依然是教学与某些 BI 工具的首选，但&quot;一张宽事实表打天下&quot;在列式仓库上往往查询更快、维护更省。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据质量门-tests-contracts-与-unit-tests\">数据质量门：tests、contracts 与 unit tests</h2><p>dbt 把数据质量内建为三种互补机制，理解它们的&quot;作用时机&quot;是用对工具的关键。下面用一条时间线区分：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[写 SQL 逻辑] --&gt; B[unit test&lt;br/&gt;物化前·验逻辑]&#10;  B --&gt; C[dbt run 物化模型]&#10;  C --&gt; D[data test&lt;br/&gt;物化后·验数据]&#10;  C --&gt; E[model contract&lt;br/&gt;物化时·强制 schema]&#10;  D --&gt; F{断言通过?}&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[下游可消费]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[阻断 / 告警]\">flowchart TD\n  A[写 SQL 逻辑] --&gt; B[unit test&lt;br/&gt;物化前·验逻辑]\n  B --&gt; C[dbt run 物化模型]\n  C --&gt; D[data test&lt;br/&gt;物化后·验数据]\n  C --&gt; E[model contract&lt;br/&gt;物化时·强制 schema]\n  D --&gt; F{断言通过?}\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt;|是| G[下游可消费]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[阻断 / 告警]</pre><p>第一类是 <strong>data test</strong>（数据测试），在模型物化<em>之后</em>对结果集断言，典型如 <code>unique</code>、<code>not_null</code>、<code>accepted_values</code>、<code>relationships</code>，或写成 schema.yml 里的泛型测试与 tests 目录下的单条 SQL 测试。第二类是 <strong>unit test</strong>（单元测试，dbt v1.8 引入），它在物化<em>之前</em>用 mock 输入验证 SQL 逻辑本身是否正确——相当于给转换逻辑写单测，而非给数据写体检（<a href=\"https://atlan.com/dbt-data-quality/\">dbt Data Quality: A Complete Guide for 2026</a>）。第三类是 <strong>model contract</strong>（模型契约），它在模型<em>创建那一刻</em>就强制 schema：声明列名、数据类型、约束，物化时若实际产出与契约不符则直接失败（<a href=\"https://docs.getdbt.com/docs/mesh/govern/model-contracts\">Model contracts | dbt Developer Hub</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# models/marts/_marts.yml&#10;models:&#10;  - name: fct_orders&#10;    config:&#10;      contract:&#10;        enforced: true # 强制 schema 契约&#10;    columns:&#10;      - name: order_id&#10;        data_type: integer&#10;        constraints:&#10;          - type: not_null&#10;          - type: unique&#10;        data_tests: [unique, not_null]&#10;      - name: order_total&#10;        data_type: numeric\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># models/marts/_marts.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">models</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fct_orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      contract</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        enforced</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 强制 schema 契约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        data_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">integer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        constraints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">not_null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">unique</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        data_tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">unique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">not_null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        data_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">numeric</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个常被误解的点：<strong>dbt tests 不等于 data contract</strong>。测试是事后验证你<em>已有</em>的数据是否符合预期，而数据契约是上游与下游之间关于&quot;将提供什么&quot;的、可执行的协议；契约里的字段约束可以<em>编译成</em>原生 dbt 测试，但契约本身的治理含义更广（<a href=\"https://medium.com/@ludovic.schmetz/your-dbt-tests-are-not-data-contracts-heres-what-is-9121052b7d29\">Your dbt Tests Are Not Data Contracts</a>）。当质量要求超出 dbt 原生能力时，生态里有 dbt-expectations（移植 Great Expectations 风格断言）、Soda（人类可读检查 + 协作式契约）、以及 Monte Carlo / Bigeye / Metaplane 这类基于机器学习的可观测性平台兜底（<a href=\"https://datacoves.com/post/dbt-data-quality-tools\">Beyond dbt Tests: Advanced Tools</a>）。</p>\n<p>衡量质量门是否&quot;够密&quot;，常用覆盖率指标。若令 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为被至少一条测试覆盖的列数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为关键列总数，则测试覆盖率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>coverage</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{coverage} = \\frac{C}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">coverage</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>；成熟团队通常对所有主键、外键与金额类列要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>coverage</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{coverage} = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">coverage</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"嵌入编排-dbt-在管道中的位置\">嵌入编排：dbt 在管道中的位置</h2><p>dbt 自己承认它不是完整编排器——内置调度有限，管不了仓库之外的摄取与反向 ETL（<a href=\"https://datadriven.io/dbt-vs-airflow\">dbt vs Airflow (2026)</a>）。因此 2026 年的生产管道几乎都是&quot;编排器 + dbt&quot;的组合：编排器定义端到端 DAG（Fivetran/Airbyte 摄取 → dbt run 转换 → 测试 → 反向 ETL 推送），dbt 只负责其中转换这一段。</p>\n<p>主流有两种集成姿态。其一是 <strong>Airflow + Cosmos</strong>：Astronomer 的开源 Cosmos 库把每个 dbt 模型渲染成一个独立的 Airflow 任务，从而获得任务级可见性、并行度与故障隔离——某个模型挂了不必重跑整个项目（<a href=\"https://www.alation.com/blog/data-orchestration-tools/\">Top Data Orchestration Tools in 2026 | Alation</a>）。其二是 <strong>Dagster 的资产中心架构</strong>：Dagster 把 dbt 模型映射为&quot;软件定义资产&quot;，天生带血缘与丰富元数据，对 dbt 重度的工作流尤其顺手（<a href=\"https://www.getorchestra.io/blog/dagster-vs-prefect-vs-airflow-complete-data-orchestration-comparison-2026\">Complete Data Orchestration Comparison 2026</a>）。下表给出选型参考：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>集成方式</th>\n<th>调度心智模型</th>\n<th>故障隔离粒度</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Airflow + Cosmos</td>\n<td>任务 DAG</td>\n<td>单个 dbt 模型</td>\n<td>已有 Airflow、需跨系统编排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dagster 原生 dbt</td>\n<td>资产 DAG</td>\n<td>单个资产</td>\n<td>dbt 重度、重血缘与元数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dbt Cloud 内置调度</td>\n<td>dbt job</td>\n<td>整个 job</td>\n<td>纯仓库转换、轻量管道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论哪种姿态，质量门的位置都一样关键：测试任务必须夹在&quot;dbt run 完成&quot;与&quot;数据对外暴露&quot;之间，失败即阻断下游，避免脏数据流到 BI 和反向 ETL。配合 <code>source freshness</code> 检查上游新鲜度，就形成了从摄取到消费的端到端可信链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>dbt 把数据建模工程化：模型即 <code>SELECT</code>，依赖由 <code>ref()</code> 自动推导成 DAG，编译期物化与调度；2026 年 Fusion 引擎（Rust，最高快 30 倍）与 dbt Core v2.0 带来列级血缘和静态分析增量构建。</li>\n<li>三层结构（staging 一对一清洗 → intermediate 拼装 → marts 面向业务实体）把复杂度关进笼子；现代仓库更偏&quot;宽表&quot;，对传统 Kimball 星型模型做了温和让步。</li>\n<li>质量三件套作用时机不同：unit test 物化前验逻辑、data test 物化后验数据、model contract 物化时强制 schema；三者覆盖关键列后达成高覆盖率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{C}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>dbt tests 不是 data contract；契约可编译成测试，治理含义更广，超出原生能力时用 dbt-expectations / Soda / Monte Carlo 兜底。</li>\n<li>dbt 不是完整编排器：生产中由 Airflow + Cosmos（任务级隔离）或 Dagster（资产中心 + 血缘）驱动，质量门必须夹在 run 与对外暴露之间。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据建模与 dbt","id":"数据建模与-dbt"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分层建模：staging → intermediate → marts","id":"分层建模-staging-intermediate-marts"},{"level":2,"text":"数据质量门：tests、contracts 与 unit tests","id":"数据质量门-tests-contracts-与-unit-tests"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌入编排：dbt 在管道中的位置","id":"嵌入编排-dbt-在管道中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据质量与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/orchestration-and-data-quality/data-quality-and-observability"},"next":null}